# ClaudeBench shader settings
profile.ULTRA=Ultra (Default)
profile.HIGH=High
profile.MEDIUM=Medium
profile.LOW=Low
profile.POTATO=Potato
option.PERFORMANCE_PROFILE=Performance Profile
option.PERFORMANCE_PROFILE.comment=Internal profile tier. Selecting a named profile resets rendering options and turns Clouds on. Other artistic settings are preserved.
value.PERFORMANCE_PROFILE.4=Ultra
value.PERFORMANCE_PROFILE.3=High
value.PERFORMANCE_PROFILE.2=Medium
value.PERFORMANCE_PROFILE.1=Low
value.PERFORMANCE_PROFILE.0=Potato
screen.QUALITY=Performance and Quality
screen.QUALITY.comment=Selecting a profile resets rendering options and turns Clouds on; other artistic settings are preserved. This page stays visible on every tier. Potato forces TAA, Colored Block Light, Volumetric Light, and screen-space reflections off, even if their controls are changed. Reflection tracing requires Medium or higher.
screen.LIGHTING=Lighting
screen.LIGHTING.comment=Shape daylight, moonlight, and the light emitted by blocks. Colored-light controls require Colored Block Light.
screen.CAVE_LIGHTING=Cave Atmosphere
screen.CAVE_LIGHTING.comment=Daylight shafts, colored dust, and depth fog in caves. Light scattering requires Volumetric Light Shafts.
screen.SKY=Sky and Weather
screen.SKY.comment=Biome atmosphere, sunsets, cloud formations, and the night sky. Performance budgets are in Performance and Quality.
screen.CLOUD_APPEARANCE=Cloud Appearance
screen.CLOUD_APPEARANCE.comment=Cloud formation, movement, mist, and lighting. Requires Clouds.
screen.NIGHT_SKY=Night Sky
screen.NIGHT_SKY.comment=Aurora, the Milky Way, and fireflies. These effects appear only when their conditions are met.
screen.WEATHER=Weather Effects
screen.WEATHER.comment=Rain ripples, storm light, and lightning illumination. These settings change shader visuals rather than Minecraft weather.
screen.WATER=Water
screen.WATER.comment=Reflections, clarity, underwater sunlight, foam, and storm waves.
screen.COLOR=Color and Brightness
screen.COLOR.comment=Image color, eye adaptation, and glow. These preferences are preserved when switching performance profiles.
screen.EXPOSURE=Image Brightness
screen.EXPOSURE.comment=Control eye adaptation for the Overworld, caves, Nether, and End.
screen.BLOOM=Bloom and Glare
screen.BLOOM.comment=Soft glow and sunlight glare. Zero removes the selected contribution; this alone does not skip its rendering pass.
screen.WORLD=World Effects
screen.WORLD.comment=Foliage animation, lava heat, and cave surface effects.
screen.CAVE_SURFACES=Cave Surfaces and Motes
screen.CAVE_SURFACES.comment=Damp rock, ore glints, glowing sculk, and soul motes.
screen.COMFORT=Visual Comfort
screen.COMFORT.comment=Shortcuts to reduce motion, glare, and landscape flashes. Lightning Illumination does not disable every Minecraft or sky flash.
option.TAA=Temporal Anti-Aliasing
option.TAA.comment=Smooths jagged edges and stabilizes fine detail while moving. Turning this off makes clouds and reflections noisier. Low performance impact. Requires Low or higher; select a higher profile to enable this effect.
option.CLOUDS=Clouds
option.CLOUDS.comment=Renders layered clouds, their reflections, and their shadows. High performance impact. Potato keeps simplified cloud layers without the full volumetric march.
option.LIGHT_FIELD=Colored Block Light
option.LIGHT_FIELD.comment=Lets nearby light sources color surfaces and atmospheric dust. Falls back to ordinary block lighting when disabled. Performance impact varies with the quality profile. Requires Low or higher; select a higher profile to enable this effect.
option.SHADOW_MAP_RES=Shadow Resolution
option.SHADOW_MAP_RES.comment=Higher resolution sharpens nearby shadows and uses more video memory. High performance impact. The shadow distance also affects sharpness. Requires Low or higher; select a higher profile to enable this effect.
option.SHADOW_DIST=Shadow Distance
option.SHADOW_DIST.comment=Distance in blocks covered by terrain shadows. A longer range costs more rendering work and spreads the shadow map over a larger area. Requires Low or higher; select a higher profile to enable this effect.
option.SHADOW_SAMPLES=Shadow Filter Samples
option.SHADOW_SAMPLES.comment=More samples smooth soft shadow edges. Off removes shadow attenuation, but does not skip shadow-map rendering or voxel lighting. Does not change the shadow map resolution. Medium performance impact. Requires Low or higher.
option.SHADOW_SOFTNESS=Shadow Softness
option.SHADOW_SOFTNESS.comment=Width of soft shadow edges. This changes the appearance; use Shadow Filter Samples to reduce noise. Requires Low or higher; select a higher profile to enable this effect.
option.CLOUD_RENDER_DISTANCE=Cloud Render Distance
option.CLOUD_RENDER_DISTANCE.comment=Horizontal range of detailed clouds in blocks, capped at 8192 regardless of Distant Horizons' distance. Detail fades into a simplified cloudy horizon; high clouds directly overhead remain visible. Higher ranges up to the cap can cost more.
option.VL_STEPS=Light Shaft Samples
option.VL_STEPS.comment=Sampling budget for Overworld light shafts and Nether and End atmospheres. Off skips volumetric sampling in every dimension; analytic haze remains. Higher values reduce noise at a higher cost. Quality profiles also control atmospheric detail. Requires Low or higher.
option.NETHER_SMOG_STEPS=Nether Smoke Samples
option.NETHER_SMOG_STEPS.comment=Samples through nearby Nether smoke. Higher values improve local light and smoke detail at a higher cost. Quality profiles can select a simpler smoke path. Requires Low or higher; select a higher profile to enable this effect.
option.SSR_STEPS=Water Reflection Samples
option.SSR_STEPS.comment=Step budget for on-screen terrain reflections in water; used only when Water SSR is enabled. Medium or higher is required; Low and Potato omit screen-space reflections even if this value is changed. Surface reflections use a separate, profile-defined budget.
option.SUN_ILLUMINANCE=Sunlight Brightness
option.SUN_ILLUMINANCE.comment=Brightness of direct daylight and the daytime atmosphere. Eye adaptation compensates for some of this change. Appearance setting; no meaningful speed benefit. Sky brightness responds on every profile; terrain lighting requires Low or higher.
option.MOON_ILLUMINANCE=Moonlight Brightness
option.MOON_ILLUMINANCE.comment=Brightness of moonlight in the sky and clouds; lower values give darker nights. Appearance setting; no meaningful speed benefit. Terrain moonlight requires Low or higher.
option.BLOCKLIGHT_STRENGTH=Block Light Brightness
option.BLOCKLIGHT_STRENGTH.comment=Brightness of vanilla block lighting, including the fallback when colored block light is disabled. Appearance setting; no meaningful speed benefit. Requires Low or higher; select a higher profile to enable this effect.
option.BLOCKLIGHT_SATURATION=Block Light Saturation
option.BLOCKLIGHT_SATURATION.comment=Color intensity of the colored light reaching surfaces. Requires Colored Block Light. Appearance setting; no meaningful speed benefit. Requires Low or higher; select a higher profile to enable this effect.
option.FIELD_BRIGHTNESS=Colored Light Brightness
option.FIELD_BRIGHTNESS.comment=Extra brightness supplied by nearby colored light sources. Requires Colored Block Light. High values can wash out cave contrast. Requires Low or higher; select a higher profile to enable this effect.
option.EMITTER_SATURATION=Light Source Color
option.EMITTER_SATURATION.comment=Color intensity captured from light source textures. Requires Colored Block Light. Fire and lava keep their designed warm colors. Requires Low or higher; select a higher profile to enable this effect.
option.LAVA_EMISSION=Lava Brightness
option.LAVA_EMISSION.comment=Brightness of glowing lava. Eye adaptation and bloom affect its final appearance. Appearance setting; no meaningful speed benefit. Requires Low or higher; select a higher profile to enable this effect.
option.BLOCK_EMISSION=Glowing Block Brightness
option.BLOCK_EMISSION.comment=Brightness of emissive blocks such as glowstone, lanterns, and froglights. Appearance setting; no meaningful speed benefit. Requires Low or higher; select a higher profile to enable this effect.
option.CLOUD_SHADOW_FLOOR=Light Through Clouds
option.CLOUD_SHADOW_FLOOR.comment=Share of direct light remaining beneath thick clouds. Lower values give deeper cloud shadows. Requires Clouds. Requires Low or higher; select a higher profile to enable this effect.
option.VOLUMETRIC_LIGHT=Volumetric Light Shafts
option.VOLUMETRIC_LIGHT.comment=Controls Overworld light shafts and scattering only. Nether smoke uses Nether Smoke Samples; Nether and End atmospheric sampling also follows Light Shaft Samples. Quality profiles control detail. Medium to high performance impact. Requires Low or higher.
option.CAVE_SUNBEAM=Cave Sunbeams
option.CAVE_SUNBEAM.comment=Strength of dusty daylight shafts through cave openings. Requires Volumetric Light Shafts. Zero removes this contribution. Requires Low or higher; select a higher profile to enable this effect.
option.CAVE_AIR_GLOW=Light in Cave Air
option.CAVE_AIR_GLOW.comment=Colored halos and dust around cave light sources. Requires Colored Block Light and Volumetric Light Shafts. Zero removes this contribution. Requires Low or higher; select a higher profile to enable this effect.
option.CAVE_DEPTH_FOG=Deep Cave Fog
option.CAVE_DEPTH_FOG.comment=Additional density of cave air deeper underground. Zero removes the depth boost. Appearance setting; no meaningful speed benefit. Requires Low or higher; select a higher profile to enable this effect.
option.SKY_CLIMATE=Biome Sky Variation
option.SKY_CLIMATE.comment=Cold, dry, humid, and coastal climates influence haze and cloud balance. Transitions ease over time. Appearance setting; no meaningful speed benefit.
option.SKY_VARIATION=Vivid Sunset Events
option.SKY_VARIATION.comment=Occasional clear evenings develop rose and violet afterglow. Lower values keep sunsets closer to ordinary gold and peach. Appearance setting; no meaningful speed benefit.
option.SUNSET_VIVIDNESS=Sunset Color Strength
option.SUNSET_VIVIDNESS.comment=Strength of the ordinary sunset palette. Vivid Sunset Events separately controls rare afterglow. Appearance setting; no meaningful speed benefit.
option.SKY_PRESET=Cloud Formation
option.SKY_PRESET.comment=Weather Clock evolves naturally with the day and weather. The other choices hold a specific cloud formation. This changes appearance, not the performance profile.
option.CLOUD_COVERAGE=Cumulus Coverage
option.CLOUD_COVERAGE.comment=Amount of low, puffy clouds when Cloud Formation is Weather Clock. Fixed formations set their own coverage. Other cloud decks keep their own weather behavior. Requires Clouds.
option.CLOUD_SPEED=Cloud Drift Speed
option.CLOUD_SPEED.comment=Speed of moving clouds and cloud shadows. Zero freezes their drift; weather can still change. Appearance setting; no meaningful speed benefit.
option.CLOUD_INSIDE_FOG=Mist Inside Clouds
option.CLOUD_INSIDE_FOG.comment=Strength of mist around the camera while inside a cloud. Zero removes nearby cloud mist. Requires Clouds. Requires Low or higher; select a higher profile to enable this effect.
option.CLOUD_MOON_SILVER=Moonlit Cloud Rims
option.CLOUD_MOON_SILVER.comment=Brightness of silver cloud edges toward the moon. Requires Clouds. Appearance setting; no meaningful speed benefit. Requires Low or higher; select a higher profile to enable this effect.
option.CLOUD_IRIDESCENCE=Cloud Iridescence
option.CLOUD_IRIDESCENCE.comment=Pastel colors in thin clouds near the sun. Zero removes this effect. Requires Clouds. Requires Low or higher; select a higher profile to enable this effect.
option.CLOUD_DUSK_SKYLIGHT=Dusk Cloud Fill Light
option.CLOUD_DUSK_SKYLIGHT.comment=Lavender and pink skylight in sunset clouds. Requires Clouds. Appearance setting; no meaningful speed benefit. Requires Low or higher; select a higher profile to enable this effect.
option.AURORA=Aurora Borealis
option.AURORA.comment=Northern lights in the dark Overworld sky. Rain and clouds obscure them. Low performance impact; the quality profile also controls sampling detail.
option.AURORA_MODE=Aurora Appearance
option.AURORA_MODE.comment=Every mode requires a dark Overworld sky. Random averages one night in ten and avoids consecutive nights. Weather and moonlight affect visibility.
option.AURORA_BRIGHTNESS=Aurora Brightness
option.AURORA_BRIGHTNESS.comment=Brightness of aurora sheets and rays. Zero makes them invisible. Appearance setting; no meaningful speed benefit.
option.MILKYWAY_BRIGHTNESS=Milky Way Brightness
option.MILKYWAY_BRIGHTNESS.comment=Brightness of the Milky Way after deep twilight. Moonlight reduces its contrast. Appearance setting; no meaningful speed benefit.
option.FIREFLIES=Fireflies
option.FIREFLIES.comment=Fireflies over warm, humid land at night. Disabled by default. Zero removes them. Some additional rendering cost when visible. Requires Low or higher; select a higher profile to enable this effect.
option.RAIN_RIPPLES=Rain Ripples
option.RAIN_RIPPLES.comment=Strength of expanding raindrop rings on water and puddles. Follows local biome precipitation. Zero removes them. Requires Low or higher; select a higher profile to enable this effect.
option.LIGHTNING_GROUND=Lightning Illumination
option.LIGHTNING_GROUND.comment=Brightness of lightning flashes across the landscape. Zero removes this illumination, but does not disable Minecraft lightning or every sky flash. Requires Low or higher; select a higher profile to enable this effect.
option.STORM_DARKNESS=Storm Darkness
option.STORM_DARKNESS.comment=How much thunderstorms darken the sky and direct light. Appearance setting; no meaningful speed benefit. Requires Low or higher; select a higher profile to enable this effect.
option.FOG_DENSITY=Atmospheric Haze
option.FOG_DENSITY.comment=Strength of distant Overworld haze. Cave and underwater fog have separate settings. Appearance setting; no meaningful speed benefit.
option.WATER_TURBIDITY=Water Murkiness
option.WATER_TURBIDITY.comment=Sediment absorption in water. Lower values make deep water clearer; higher values make it murkier. Appearance setting; no meaningful speed benefit.
option.WATER_SURFACE_VEIL=Water Surface Haze
option.WATER_SURFACE_VEIL.comment=Amount of light scattered immediately beneath the water surface. Higher values make the surface appear milkier. Appearance setting; no meaningful speed benefit.
option.WATER_SSR=Terrain Reflections on Water
option.WATER_SSR.comment=Reflects on-screen terrain in water. Sky reflections remain when disabled. Medium performance impact. Water Reflection Samples controls its tracing budget. Requires Medium or higher; Low and Potato omit the screen-space reflection path.
option.CAUSTIC_STRENGTH=Underwater Caustics
option.CAUSTIC_STRENGTH.comment=Brightness of moving sunlight patterns on shallow water floors. Zero removes the visible pattern. Requires Low or higher; select a higher profile to enable this effect.
option.SHORE_FOAM=Shore Foam
option.SHORE_FOAM.comment=Strength of pale foam where water meets the shore. Zero removes the foam. Appearance setting; no meaningful speed benefit. Requires Low or higher; select a higher profile to enable this effect.
option.STORM_WAVES=Storm Wave Strength
option.STORM_WAVES.comment=Additional water wave height during rain and thunderstorms. Zero keeps storm waves at the clear-weather baseline. Requires Low or higher; select a higher profile to enable this effect.
option.SATURATION=Color Saturation
option.SATURATION.comment=Overall color intensity. Zero gives a grayscale image. Appearance setting; no meaningful speed benefit.
option.GRADE_CONTRAST=Contrast
option.GRADE_CONTRAST.comment=Strength of the image contrast curve across dimensions. Potato uses a cheaper display-space curve. Zero removes this contrast shaping. Appearance setting; no meaningful speed benefit.
option.GRADE_VIBRANCE=Color Vibrance
option.GRADE_VIBRANCE.comment=Extra color in less saturated Overworld areas. Zero removes this grade. Appearance setting; no meaningful speed benefit. Requires Low or higher; select a higher profile to enable this effect.
option.DUSK_VIBRANCE=Dusk Vibrance
option.DUSK_VIBRANCE.comment=Extra color through the sunset window. Appearance setting; no meaningful speed benefit. Requires Low or higher; select a higher profile to enable this effect.
option.EXPOSURE_KEY=Image Brightness
option.EXPOSURE_KEY.comment=Target brightness used by Overworld eye adaptation. Higher values brighten the image. Appearance setting; no meaningful speed benefit. Requires Low or higher; select a higher profile to enable this effect.
option.DUSK_EXPOSURE=Dusk Brightness
option.DUSK_EXPOSURE.comment=Additional image brightness as daylight fades. Appearance setting; no meaningful speed benefit. Requires Low or higher; select a higher profile to enable this effect.
option.EXPOSURE_MAX_CAVE=Cave Brightness Limit
option.EXPOSURE_MAX_CAVE.comment=Maximum eye adaptation in caves. Lower values preserve darker caves; higher values reveal more detail. Appearance setting; no meaningful speed benefit. Requires Low or higher; select a higher profile to enable this effect.
option.EXPOSURE_KEY_OTHERWORLD=Nether and End Brightness
option.EXPOSURE_KEY_OTHERWORLD.comment=Target brightness used by eye adaptation in the Nether and End, within their exposure limits. Appearance setting; no meaningful speed benefit. Requires Low or higher; select a higher profile to enable this effect.
option.BLOOM_STRENGTH=Bloom Strength
option.BLOOM_STRENGTH.comment=Soft glow from bright areas. Zero removes the general bloom contribution. Other glow controls remain separate. Requires Low or higher; select a higher profile to enable this effect.
option.GLARE_STRENGTH=Glare Strength
option.GLARE_STRENGTH.comment=Wide glow around bright highlights. Zero removes this glare contribution. Appearance setting; no meaningful speed benefit. Requires Low or higher; select a higher profile to enable this effect.
option.LOW_SUN_GLARE=Low Sun Glare
option.LOW_SUN_GLARE.comment=Additional wide glare around sunrise and sunset. Zero removes this additional glare. Requires Low or higher; select a higher profile to enable this effect.
option.SUN_VEIL=Sunlight Veil
option.SUN_VEIL.comment=Brightness of the broad veil around a visible sun. Zero removes it. Lower values can make bright horizons easier to look at. Requires Low or higher; select a higher profile to enable this effect.
option.SUN_RAYS_STRENGTH=Sun Ray Glow
option.SUN_RAYS_STRENGTH.comment=Strength of the subtle screen-space glow around the sun. Zero removes this contribution. Appearance setting; no meaningful speed benefit. Requires Medium or higher; Low and Potato omit sun ray sampling.
option.EMITTER_BLOOM=Light Source Bloom
option.EMITTER_BLOOM.comment=Thresholded glow around bright emitters such as lava and glowstone. Zero removes this contribution. Requires Low or higher; select a higher profile to enable this effect.
option.EMITTER_BLOOM_THRESHOLD=Light Source Bloom Threshold
option.EMITTER_BLOOM_THRESHOLD.comment=Brightness needed for extra light-source glow, relative to the scene. Higher values limit this glow to brighter sources. Requires Low or higher; select a higher profile to enable this effect.
option.WAVING_FOLIAGE=Foliage Animation
option.WAVING_FOLIAGE.comment=Wind animation on leaves, grass, and plants. Disabling it keeps foliage still. Small performance impact.
option.WAVE_STRENGTH=Foliage Sway Strength
option.WAVE_STRENGTH.comment=Horizontal movement of wind-blown foliage. Requires Foliage Animation. Turning Foliage Animation off removes all foliage movement.
option.CAVE_WETNESS=Damp Cave Surfaces
option.CAVE_WETNESS.comment=Gloss and wetness on cave rock where daylight does not reach. Zero removes this contribution. Requires Low or higher; select a higher profile to enable this effect.
option.ORE_SPARKLE=Ore Sparkle
option.ORE_SPARKLE.comment=Strength of small ore glints under nearby block light. Zero removes them. Requires Low or higher; select a higher profile to enable this effect.
option.SCULK_GLOW=Sculk Glow
option.SCULK_GLOW.comment=Brightness of sculk specks that pulse with their heartbeat. Zero removes the glow. Requires Low or higher; select a higher profile to enable this effect.
option.SOUL_MOTES=Deep Dark Motes
option.SOUL_MOTES.comment=Strength of drifting soul motes in Deep Dark air. Zero removes the motes. Requires Low or higher; select a higher profile to enable this effect.
option.LAVA_HEAT=Lava Heat Effects
option.LAVA_HEAT.comment=Nearby lava heat effects, including glowing embers and the red heat vignette. Zero removes them. Some additional rendering cost when visible. Requires Low or higher; select a higher profile to enable this effect.
