profile.ULTRA.comment=Full rendering detail. Matches the source defaults. Resets rendering options and turns Clouds on; other artistic settings are preserved.
profile.HIGH.comment=Reduced rendering budgets with most fine detail retained. Resets rendering options and turns Clouds on; other artistic settings are preserved.
profile.MEDIUM.comment=Balanced clouds, shadows, reflections, and atmospheric sampling. Resets rendering options and turns Clouds on; other artistic settings are preserved.
profile.LOW.comment=Simplified rendering detail. Screen-space reflection tracing is omitted; temporal anti-aliasing and colored block light remain enabled. Resets rendering options and turns Clouds on; other artistic settings are preserved.
profile.POTATO.comment=Vanilla lightmap with simplified sky, clouds, water, and fog. HDR adaptation, voxel light, light shafts, screen-space reflections, bloom, and temporal anti-aliasing are disabled. Resets rendering options and turns Clouds on; other artistic settings are preserved.
screen.POTATO=Potato Settings
screen.POTATO.comment=Controls that remain active with the Potato renderer. Select a higher profile before using effects whose tooltips require Low or higher.
